<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Synthetics down 7.91 percent.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Synthetics down 7.91 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Synthetics slipped 0.85 rupees, or 7.91 percent, to 9.90 after the company announced a half-year loss of 47 million rupees, dealers said.</p>
<p>Turnover of 20,000 shares of the company's stock was recorded at the Karachi bourse in early trade.</p>
<p>&quot;This kind of result was expected as overall the synthetic sector is passing through a bad patch,&quot; said dealer Hina Akhlaq of KASB &amp; Co. The company's financial year ends in December.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
